# A decorator, whose φ refers to an object with data.
#
#   ⟦ bar ↦ ⟦ Δ ⤍ 00-00-00-00-00-00-00-2A ⟧, foo ↦ ⟦ φ ↦ Φ.bar ⟧ ⟧
#
# The script below is printed by `phino sodg` 0.0.167.

F c0 bar foo
F c1
Δ c1 00-00-00-00-00-00-00-2A
P c0 bar c1
F c2 φ
D c3 c0 bar
P c2 φ c3
P c0 foo c2
